dialect protocol
protocol present.spr
version 1
schema animate.present.deck.mutation
start record
framing record
record animate.present-add-layer tag 1
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record animate.present-set-stroke tag 2
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record animate.present-move-layer tag 3
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
chain hash u64
